#. 【ちょっと妙】
msgctxt "0001 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "[very unusual]"
msgstr ""

#. 妙って…どこが？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Unusual? What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#. 床をすみずみまで調べてみたんだけど…
msgctxt "0003 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I've searched your floor from one corner to another..."
msgstr ""

#. この部屋には、髪の毛が１本たりとも
#. 落ちていなかったわ…
msgctxt "0004 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...and I didn't find one single strand of hair."
msgstr ""

#. い、１本も…？
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Really...?"
msgstr ""

#. 被害者となった舞園さんの物はもちろん、
#. 部屋の持ち主である、あなたの物もね…
msgctxt "0006 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Not one hair from the victim, and not one hair from\n"
"you, even though you've been living in here."
msgstr ""

#. そう言えば、ボクもさっき調べてた時に、
#. 気付いたんだけどさ…
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You know, now that you mention it...I noticed\n"
"something while I was looking around before."
msgstr ""

#. ボクの部屋の粘着テープクリーナーが、
#. いつの間にか使われてたみたいなんだ。
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It looked like the lint roller in my room had been\n"
"used, but I never touched it."
msgstr ""

#. もしかして、誰かがあれを使って…
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Could someone have used it to...?"
msgstr ""

#. なるほどね…
msgctxt "0010 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Very interesting..."
msgstr ""

#. 髪の毛１本落ちていない部屋…
#. いつの間にか使用されてたテープクリーナー…
msgctxt "0011 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Your room didn't have a single hair in it, and someone\n"
"used your lint roller without your knowledge."
msgstr ""

#. つまり…あなた以外の誰かが、
#. この部屋を掃除したって事になるわね。
msgctxt "0012 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"In other words...someone other than you came in and\n"
"scrubbed your room clean."
msgstr ""

#. それって…舞園さんが？　
#. それとも犯人が？
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Was it...Sayaka? Or the killer?"
msgstr ""

#. さぁ、どうでしょうね？
msgctxt "0014 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That's the question, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>苗木の部屋の清掃状況<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Makoto's Room Cleanliness<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the\n"
"Truth Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まずは、この部屋の状況を
#. 詳しく調べてみよう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd better examine the state of my room a little\n"
"closer.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そうすれば…
#. 何かわかるかもしれない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That might reveal something new...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 見張りをしてて気付いたんだけどよぉ…
msgctxt "0018 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Ya know, I realized something while I was on guard\n"
"duty..."
msgstr ""

#. すでに犯人が証拠を隠滅したって可能性もあるよな？
#. 例えば、死体が発見される前とかによぉ…
msgctxt "0019 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"The killer could've already destroyed some evidence,\n"
"right? Before anyone found the body, I mean."
msgstr ""

#. こっちの寄宿舎には<CLT 3>“ゴミ捨て場”<CLT>もあったしな。
#. あそこで処分してっかもしんねーぞ…
msgctxt "0020 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"There's a <CLT 3>trash room<CLT> here in the dorms, right? They\n"
"coulda tossed some stuff in there..."
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…その可能性はあるかも…
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Y-Yeah, that's definitely possible."
msgstr ""

#. クソヤローがぁッ！！
msgctxt "0022 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "That dirty bastard...!"
msgstr ""

#. 大体よ、オレは女に手を上げるヤツは許せねぇんだ。
#. そんなヤツは万死に値する、そう兄貴に教わったんだ。
msgctxt "0023 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Anyone who raises their hand to a woman is scum that\n"
"deserves death. That's what my brother taught me."
msgstr ""

#. つー訳で、舞園を殺したヤツは許せねぇ！
#. よゆーで、メリッと殺す！
msgctxt "0024 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"So if I ever find the son of a bitch that did this,\n"
"I'm gonna pound his goddamn face in."
msgstr ""

#. で、でもさ…犯人が女の人だったら？
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "B-But...what if it was a girl that did it?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0026 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. そん時は…そん時だ。
msgctxt "0027 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "That'll all get sorted out when the time comes."
msgstr ""

#. 大神さんも…ボクが犯人だと思ってるの？
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Sakura...do *you* think I'm guilty, too?"
msgstr ""

#. 我には推理など出来ぬ。
#. 貴様が犯人かどうかなど…我にはわからぬ。
msgctxt "0029 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I try not to make assumptions like that. I simply\n"
"don't know whether or not you did this."
msgstr ""

#. 我は従うだけだ。貴様らが出した結論にな…
msgctxt "0030 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Whatever decision the rest of you come up with, I will\n"
"follow your lead."
msgstr ""

#. そっか…
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

#. あのさ、霧切さん…
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hey, Kyoko..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは、現場で捜査している彼女に
#. そっと声をかけてみた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I quietly called her name while she was investigating\n"
"the area.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>のだが……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 何…やってんの？
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What are you doing...?"
msgstr ""

#. …見ればわかるでしょう？
msgctxt "0036 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Isn't it obvious?"
msgstr ""

#. いや、わかんないけど…
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "N-No, not really..."
msgstr ""

#. 捜査よ。
msgctxt "0038 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I'm searching."
msgstr ""

#. 捜査って…？
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Searching...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女は、膝をたたんだ体勢で、
#. ボクの部屋の床を隅々までじっくり見回していた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She was down on her knees, carefully inspecting every\n"
"inch of my room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …コンタクトでも落とした？
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Did you lose a contact or something?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0042 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>よくわからないけど…
#. もの凄く集中しているみたいだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I dunno what she's doing exactly, but...she seems to\n"
"be concentrating pretty hard on it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>と、その直後…
#. 不意に彼女は立ち上がった。そして…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But a few seconds later, she suddenly stood up\n"
"straight and said...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あなた…潔癖症？
msgctxt "0045 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Are you a clean freak?"
msgstr ""

#. え？　いや…違うけど…
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? N-No, I don't think so. But what...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>すると彼女は小さく頷きながら、
#. ボクの部屋の床を見回すようにして言った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Nodding, she glanced around my room one more time.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. なるほどね…
msgctxt "0048 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Interesting..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>何が…なるほど…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What's interesting...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. やっぱり、この部屋って<CLT 1>【ちょっと妙】<CLT>だわ。
msgctxt "0050 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Just as I suspected, there's something \n"
"<CLT 1>[very unusual]<CLT> about your room."
msgstr ""

#. やっぱり、この部屋って<CLT 1>【ちょっと妙】<CLT>だわ。
#. あなたもそう思わない？
msgctxt "0051 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Just as I suspected, there's something \n"
"<CLT 1>[very unusual]<CLT> about your room. \n"
"Wouldn't you agree?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>部屋のベッドや壁に、
#. 傷付けられたような跡がいくつもある。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are scratches and gouges on my walls and bed.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 争った形跡…ってヤツか？
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Is that...evidence of a struggle?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり、この部屋では、
#. 確実に<CLT><CLT 3>“争い事”<CLT><CLT 4>があったはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It looks like there must have been some kind of\n"
"<CLT><CLT 3>fight<CLT><CLT 4> in my room...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. クソ…隣の部屋にいたボクが気付いていれば…！
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Dammit...! I was right there in the other room! If\n"
"only I'd heard something!"
msgstr ""

#. それは無理な話だ。
msgctxt "0056 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "That would not have been possible."
msgstr ""

#. …えっ？
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. 前に聞かなかったか？
#. この個室は完全防音になっている。
msgctxt "0058 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Don't you remember? All of our rooms are completely\n"
"soundproof."
msgstr ""

#. つまり…隣の部屋で何かあろうとも、
#. それに気付く事は不可能。
msgctxt "0059 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"So something could happen in the room right next to\n"
"you, and there's no way you could know."
msgstr ""

#. あるいは、これもモノクマの策略かもしれんな。
#. 殺人が起きるのにうってつけの環境自体が…
msgctxt "0060 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Perhaps this was another of Monokuma's strategies,\n"
"creating an ideal setting for murder..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>争った形跡<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0062 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Evidence of a Struggle<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

